\image{conf-neuromodec-hh-operators.jpg}

\p{\strong{Caption.} Fourier and Laplace \strong{Neural Operators} (FNO / LNO) trained to reproduce stiff \strong{Hodgkin-Huxley} membrane dynamics orders of magnitude faster than conventional ODE solvers, evaluated by a rate-of-agreement metric across DC/AC/AC+DC stimulus regimes. The fast forward-model layer under any simulation-kernel voting scheme like ours ([[bcf-devices]]): if HH runs in real time, per-vote world-simulation becomes cheap.}
